  "prefLabel": "Cor 204.01 Date of Issuance or Filing",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-08-03",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 204.01 Date of Issuance or Filing. All written documents governed by these rules shall have a rebuttable presumption of having been issued on the date noted on the document and to have been filed with the department on the actual date of receipt by the department, as evidenced by a date stamp placed on the document by the department in the normal course of business.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 200) #7447, eff 2-6-01; ss by #9382, INTERIM, eff 2-3-09, EXPIRES: 8-3-09; ss by #9507-A, eff 7-8-09; ss by #12501, eff 3-23-18",
